  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Mister Richard Smoker (cuts)** (1 other source): Most of this song is missing from the recording [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Back To Basum**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Do You Feel (Like I Feel)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Dazed and Confused**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Stella Blue**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Push th' Little Daisies**: back after 41 archived shows (702 days) [2]\n- **Beck Bullshit\"**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Common Bitch**: back after 106 archived shows (2275 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1999-07-30** (recommended): audience recording; 38 songs; 184 min [1]. Said about its sound: The recording has gaps: Waving My Dick In the Wind is also largely missing [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1999-07-30**: taped by unknown; source: unknown AUD [1]",
